<title>USA: Salomon names Knight head of equity research.</title>
<headline>Salomon names Knight head of equity research.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Inc's Salomon Brothers unit said it named Ann Knight as head of global equity research.</p>
<p>Knight was previously director of research at PaineWebber Group Inc.</p>
<p>Knight replaces James Crandell, who will focus on running the U.S. and Latin American equity research units.</p>
<p>Salomon has 165 analysts who track about 1,800 companies worldwide.</p>
<p>Both Knight and Crandell will report to Rod Berens, head of global equities.</p>
